{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeH4Wedderburn","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeH4Wedderburn","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeH4WedderburnInv"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.wedderburn₄","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.wedderburn₄","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4Wedderburn.lean#L73-L116","doc":"**The rank-4 Wedderburn isomorphism (sorry-free):**\n$H_4(q) \\cong K \\times K \\times M_2(K) \\times M_3(K) \\times M_3(K)$\nwhenever `q ≠ 0`, `q ^ 2 + 1 ≠ 0`, `q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1 ≠ 0` and\n`q ^ 4 + 1 ≠ 0` — exactly the Wenzl genericity locus at rank 4, read\noff the determinant of the coordinate map.  Injectivity is the\ncoordinate left inverse `wedderburnInvV₄_left`; surjectivity is the\nexplicit inverse with the five right-inverse component lemmas. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.wedderburnHom₄_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.wedderburnHom₄_apply","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4Wedderburn.lean#L66-L71","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.wedderburnHom₄","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.wedderburnHom₄","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4Wedderburn.lean#L52-L64","doc":"**The assembled Wedderburn homomorphism (sorry-free)**\n$(\\chi_+, \\chi_-, \\rho_{22}, \\rho_{31}, \\rho_{211}) :\nH_4(q) \\to K \\times K \\times M_2(K) \\times M_3(K) \\times M_3(K)$,\nassembled by `AlgHom.prod` from the five committed block algebra\nhomomorphisms. ","signatureChunk":0}]}